 HOLD[n]=(c[str(n)]['parts'],'Shared glyphs retained and rounded W turns preserved during grid fitting, but full inspection still reports internal spacing warnings between the W branches. No glyph replacement, nonuniform stretch, or validator exemption was used. The candidate remains a review draft.')

